    "description": "Since 2019, Yaki Ya! has served vibrant Japanese street food, starting at Bang Bang Oriental Food Hall and now expanding to Finchley Road, London. Honoured to be named North London’s Restaurant of the Year by ARTA, Yaki Ya! believes food is more than fuel – it’s an experience. Our Chicken Katsu Curry is iconic, with crispy, golden panko-coated chicken in savoury curry sauce. Tantalizing Fusionend Ramen Soup that’s a party in your mouth. Love street food classics? Try our crispy Takoyaki, perfect for sharing (or not!), and our Tiger Prawn Tempura – golden and addictive. For noodle lovers, Yakisoba and Udon are loaded with flavours that bring joy to every bite.Our entire menu is HALAL and created with bold, unforgettable flavours. Finchley Road’s ambiance is warm and stylish, with wood-panelled walls, chic benches, and pendant lighting creating a cosy space.Join us at Yaki Ya! Finchley Road – we promise you’ll leave with a happy heart and full stomach. See you soon!",
