            "date": "2024-12-21T20:30:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "Really enjoyed the chicken and beef Udon noodles. Lovely, friendly staff and just a very calm dinning experience on a cold night.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Fatema",
            "date": "2024-12-14T21:30:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "🍜🍗 Craving comfort? Yaki Ya!'s got you covered! 😋\n\nJust had their Seafood Udon Soup and OMG 🤤 So. Much. Flavor! Fresh seafood + perfect noodles = heaven in a bowl!\n\nAnd don't get me started on that Chicken Teriyaki Bowl 🔥 Juicy chicken, killer sauce, fluffy rice. Lunch goals, anyone?\n\nTrust me, your taste buds will thank you!",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "k",
            "date": "2024-12-13T21:15:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "I tried 3 items gyoza, beef teriyaki, and salmon bento box and they are fantastic! The gyoza are crispy and flavorful, the teriyaki beef is tender and delicious, and the salmon bento is a perfect, well-balanced meal.\n\nA must-try for Japanese food lovers!",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Billy",
            "date": "2024-12-12T20:00:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "Had a delightful time at Yaki Ya. The portion sizes were excellent and very reasonably priced! The Teriyaki duck noodles were delicious as was the chicken katsu curry.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Yamina",
            "date": "2024-12-12T17:45:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "Loved it!\nVery welcoming and amazing food ❤️\nI loved the prawn katsu, mochis, yakisoba and spicy koji chicken! Would highly recommend to everyone 😍",
            "tags": null
